        "cooked": "<p>@Trajector: That bit <em>was</em> pretty fair, though. They straight up told us in the podcast it was Argent versus Dark Visionary at several points, and Argent's podcast noted he's good at neutralizing threats in non-combat ways (which he did to both Naturalist and Dark Vis).</p>",
