        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-16T15:26:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I didn't send a bracket in since we had so little info on the setting, how the tournament worked, etc.</p><p>Absolute Zero was personal favorite of mine. He performed so well, being able to take the whole tech bracket even as his suit was being torn appart. I was greatly impressed on how in the Parse fight he was all \"Yeah, you broke my suit. Who hasn't?\" and then just froze her in a block of ice. Anlyze that.</p><p>All I'm gonna say regarding Fanatic is that I was rooting for Blade by the point those two fought.</p>",
