        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-16T15:45:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was rooting for Blade for just about his every match, really, for the entertainment value. I especially loved the special brand of sheer pettiness in the wholly unnecessary tasering of the Chairman. But yeah, watching Fanatic go down to one of the most normal participants in the whole thing was particularly entertaining.</p><p>Felt pretty conflicted when he got to facing AZ, though. Poor AZ. :(</p>",
